<title>UK: Railtrack half year profits jump.</title>
<headline>Railtrack half year profits jump.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.0		   vs 22.2</p>
<p> Shr pro forma (pence)  29.0		   vs 27.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.3		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     173		    vs 98</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.204 billion	vs 1.139</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 149 to 155 million stg.</p>
<p> Operating profit	 169		    vs 151</p>
<p> Interest payable	 19		     vs 62</p>
<p> Tax charge		 28		     vs 13 credit</p>
<p> Net taxed		  145		    vs 111</p>
<p> Retained		   108		    vs 111</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
